    rdf:value "- Myron Bement Smith handwritten caption in English reads, \"47.P; Box 15.2: Military review.\" [Myron Bement Smith Collection, Subseries 2.1: Islamic Archives History, Collection Information; Box 60; Folder 44: 47 P: Antoine Sevruguin, glass negatives, Iran]" .

