    crm:P72_has_language lang:und ;
    rdf:value "\"Based on the diaries of Nasir Al-Din shah, the hunting camps close to Tehran can be identified as Tange Soloqan and Kan village.\" [Freer Gallery of Art and Arthur M. Sackler Gallery Archives, Curatorial Research Assistant]" .

