    crm:P72_has_language lang:und ;
    rdf:value "- Handwritten information on slip of paper (from a 1943-1944 cash book, produced by the Bathni Brothers, Tehran) reads, \"36) Mustofiyi Mamalik.\" [Myron Bement Smith Collection, Subseries 2.1: Islamic Archives History, Collection Information]" .

kg:note_ref10368_scopecontent_3_p_0 a crm:E33_Linguistic_Object ;
    crm:P72_has_language lang:und ;
    rdf:value "- Myron Bement Smith handwritten caption in English reads, \"47.P; Box 41.2: Mustofizi Mamalik (#36).\" [Myron Bement Smith Collection, Subseries 2.1: Islamic Archives History, Collection Information; Box 60; Folder 44: 47 P: Antoine Sevruguin, glass negatives, Iran]" .

