kg:note_ref10412_scopecontent_0_p_0 a crm:E33_Linguistic_Object ;
    crm:P72_has_language lang:und ;
    rdf:value "\"Ceremony at archway commemorating the coronation of Reza Shah Pahlavi, Tehran. The Taq (arch) is framed on the top by a poem, celebrating the inauguration of the Pahlavi Shah. (possibly related to FSA A.4 2.12.GN.43.04).\" [Freer Gallery of Art and Arthur M. Sackler Gallery Archives, Curatorial Research Assistant]" .

