    rdf:value "\"Myron B. Smith's caption identifies this image as Chahar Bagh, however, the Chahar Bagh avenue has been historically much wider and much more urbanized.\" [Freer Gallery of Art and Arthur M. Sackler Gallery Archives, Curatorial Research Assistant]" .

