    crm:P72_has_language lang:und ;
    rdf:value "- Handwritten information on slip of paper (from a 1943-1944 cash book, produced by the Bathni Brothers, Tehran) reads, \"42) Saltanatabad.\" [Myron Bement Smith Collection, Subseries 2.1: Islamic Archives History, Collection Information]" .

