kg:note_ref10436_scopecontent_0_p_0 a crm:E33_Linguistic_Object ;
    crm:P72_has_language lang:und ;
    rdf:value "\"The photo depicts the two pages of Shahnama in binding. The two pages, now separated, are in Metropolitan Museum of Art's collection (52.20.9b). The pages are from the Shahnama of Muhammad al-Qivam al-Shirazi, illustrated by Muhammad ibn Taj al-Din Haidar Muzahhib Shirazi (active 1560s-80s). The manuscript is thus dated to 1562-1583. Initially it was in Kelekian's private collection which was sold to the Metropolitan Museum of Art upon his death and in 1952.\" [Freer Gallery of Art and Arthur M. Sackler Gallery Archives, Curatorial Research Assistant]" .

kg:note_ref10436_scopecontent_1_p_0 a crm:E33_Linguistic_Object ;
