    crm:P72_has_language lang:und ;
    rdf:value "- FSg curatorial research specialist remark on Antoin Sevruguin photo manipulation reads, \"The emulsion of the background of the figure is completely scratched off. There are pieces of paper attached to the edges of the negative. The bottom of the dress, the collars and the right edge of the scarf have ink marks and scratch marks on the to enhance the texture of the dress. The face has very thin markings and touch ups. The left edge is cut.\"" .

