    crm:P72_has_language lang:und ;
    rdf:value "\"Four Pahlavi guards, a man and two young boys are standing in front of what seems to be a palace entrance. Could be Sa'd-abad palace entrance.\" [Freer Gallery of Art and Arthur M. Sackler Gallery Archives, Curatorial Research Assistant]" .

