kg:note_ref9934_scopecontent_0_p_0 a crm:E33_Linguistic_Object ;
    crm:P72_has_language lang:und ;
    rdf:value "\"Copy print of another photograph. The original photo is not an albumen print, indicated by the white borders. A close comparison of the background of the image with another image in the collection (1.7) indicates that this image -like the othe rone of the national bank of Iran- might be taken later in the 1930s.\" [Freer Gallery of Art and Arthur M. Sackler Gallery Archives, Curatorial Research Assistant]" .

