    rdf:value "Scope and Contents - Myron Bement Smith handwritten caption in English reads, \"47.P; Box 12.9: Iran. Photograph of etching: Court musicians.\" [Myron Bement Smith Collection, Subseries 2.1: Islamic Archives History, Collection Information; Box 60; Folder 44: 47 P: Antoine Sevruguin, glass negatives, Iran]" ;
    mbs:noteType mbs:ScopeContent .

kg:note_ref10060_arrangement_0 a crm:E33_Linguistic_Object ;
