    rdf:value "Scope and Contents - FSg curatorial research specialist remark on Antoin Sevruguin photo manipulation reads, \"A piece of paper is stuck all through the sky to make it appear a consistent white.\"" ;
    mbs:noteType mbs:ScopeContent .

