    crm:P72_has_language lang:und ;
    rdf:value "Scope and Contents \"Family portrait in studio. The backdrop of the studio comprise of a drape and a painted scene of railings and curtains. The three seated women, the older one sitting in the middle, are flanked by a young boy standing to their right.\" [Freer Gallery of Art and Arthur M. Sackler Gallery Archives, Curatorial Research Assistant]" ;
    mbs:noteType mbs:ScopeContent .

