    rdf:value "Scope and Contents - Handwritten information on slip of paper (from a 1943-1944 cash book, produced by the Bathni Brothers, Tehran) reads, \"48) Reza Pahlevi and Russian Ambassador.\" [Myron Bement Smith Collection, Subseries 2.1: Islamic Archives History, Collection Information]" ;
    mbs:noteType mbs:ScopeContent .

