    rdf:value "Scope and Contents - FSg curatorial research specialist remark on Antoin Sevruguin photo manipulation reads, \"The glass negative has the photographer's signature. The right side wall is painted over with black ink and the left side wall is completely eliminated by chopping off the emulsion. The four sides of the glass are rugged.\"" ;
    mbs:noteType mbs:ScopeContent .

