    rdf:value "Scope and Contents - FSg curatorial research specialist remark on Antoin Sevruguin photo manipulation reads, \"There are visible brush marks all over the centre of the image, which might be the results of applying varnish.\"" ;
    mbs:noteType mbs:ScopeContent .

