    rdf:value "Scope and Contents - FSg curatorial research specialist remark on Antoin Sevruguin photo manipulation reads, \"The sky is covered with brownish paper. The area between the paper and the structure is filled with black ink. The photographer has meticulously darkened various areas in the foreground and the top of the walls of the structure.\"" ;
    mbs:noteType mbs:ScopeContent .

