    rdf:value "Scope and Contents \"From the motifs of the tiles one can guess that they are most probably intended to secular/residential decoration. On the right side of the photo's mid-ground a group of musicians are accompanying the performance of a dancing figure.\" [Freer Gallery of Art and Arthur M. Sackler Gallery Archives, Curatorial Research Assistant]" ;
    mbs:noteType mbs:ScopeContent .

