    rdf:value "Scope and Contents - FSg curatorial research specialist remark on Antoin Sevruguin photo manipulation reads, \"The glass is very thick. The face is touched up. On the left and top there are marks for chopping off the glass on both sides of the glass plate. The four sides have been chopped off to eliminate the border.\"" ;
    mbs:noteType mbs:ScopeContent .

