    crm:P72_has_language lang:und ;
    rdf:value "Scope and Contents \"Ceremony at archway commemorating the coronation of Reza Shah Pahlavi, Tehran. The Taq (arch) is framed on the top by a poem, celebrating the inauguration of the Pahlavi Shah. (possibly related to FSA A.4 2.12.GN.43.04).\" [Freer Gallery of Art and Arthur M. Sackler Gallery Archives, Curatorial Research Assistant]" ;
    mbs:noteType mbs:ScopeContent .

