    rdf:value "Scope and Contents - FSg curatorial research specialist remark on Antoin Sevruguin photo manipulation reads, \"He retouched all the faces and put varnish on them. The left side of the negative has a lighter rectangle on which the image is not developed. The photographer painted the background on the image wi ink.\"" ;
