    rdf:value "Scope and Contents - FSg curatorial research specialist remark on Antoin Sevruguin photo manipulation reads, \"White piece of paper stuck to the bottom edge. The tow side edges are chopped off.\"" ;
    mbs:noteType mbs:ScopeContent .

