    rdf:value "Scope and Contents - FSg curatorial research specialist remark on Antoin Sevruguin photo manipulation reads, \"The area around the figure is covered in white paper on the back and the area between the figure and the paper is covered in ink.\"" ;
    mbs:noteType mbs:ScopeContent .

