    rdf:value "Scope and Contents - FSg curatorial research specialist remark on Antoin Sevruguin photo manipulation reads, \"The background curtain, the king's medals and hat. The right side of the curtain is completely painted over but the touch up in this case is not on the negative. It might have been that this is a reprint of an image and the touch ups are on the print.\"" ;
