    rdf:value "Scope and Contents - FSg curatorial research specialist remark on Antoin Sevruguin photo manipulation reads, \"The faces are carefully touched up. There is a consistent halo around all the three faces. The dress of the woman is very carefully touched up with ink around the top and the line around her dress.\"" ;
