    rdf:value "Scope and Contents - FSg curatorial research specialist remark on Antoin Sevruguin photo manipulation reads, \"The face is carefully touched up. There is a halo of a the varnish around the face.\"" ;
    mbs:noteType mbs:ScopeContent .

