kg:note_ref10543_scopecontent_0 a crm:E33_Linguistic_Object ;
    rdfs:label "Scope and Contents" ;
    crm:P148_has_component kg:note_ref10543_scopecontent_0_p_0 ;
    crm:P2_has_type mbs:ScopeContent ;
    crm:P72_has_language lang:und ;
    rdf:value "Scope and Contents \"The sign reads: The branch of Haji Abd al-Rahim Rizayof Shirvani Brothers. According to a letter to the congress in 1910, the headquarters of the family business was located in Rasht, Gilan. The view in the photograph, however, suggests that the photo was taken in Tehran. The street scene is the same as the one photographed in Neg.17.7. the point of view of this one is a bit further to the north of the street.\" [Freer Gallery of Art and Arthur M. Sackler Gallery Archives, Curatorial Research Assistant]" ;
    mbs:noteType mbs:ScopeContent .

