    rdf:value "Scope and Contents - Myron Bement Smith handwritten caption in English reads, \"47.P; Box 1.4: Iran - a darvish.\" [Myron Bement Smith Collection, Subseries 2.1: Islamic Archives History, Collection Information; Box 60; Folder 44: 47 P: Antoine Sevruguin, glass negatives, Iran]" ;
    mbs:noteType mbs:ScopeContent .

