    crm:P2_has_type mbs:ScopeContent ;
    crm:P72_has_language lang:und ;
    rdf:value "Scope and Contents \"Copy print of another photograph. The original photo is not an albumen print, indicated by the white borders. A close comparison of the background of the image with another image in the collection (1.7) indicates that this image -like the othe rone of the national bank of Iran- might be taken later in the 1930s.\" [Freer Gallery of Art and Arthur M. Sackler Gallery Archives, Curatorial Research Assistant]" ;
    mbs:noteType mbs:ScopeContent .

