    rdf:value "Scope and Contents - FSg curatorial research specialist remark on Antoin Sevruguin photo condition reads, \"On the non-emulsion side of the negative a piece of paper is glued to the angles that covers the sky area around the top of the structure.\"" ;
    mbs:noteType mbs:ScopeContent .

