        "Scope and Contents - Handwritten information on slip of paper (from a 1943-1944 cash book, produced by the Bathni Brothers, Tehran) reads, \"476) Woman with chadur pitchah.\" [Myron Bement Smith Collection, Subseries 2.1: Islamic Archives History, Collection Information]",
