        "Local Numbers FSA A.4 2.12.GN.30.12",
        "Scope and Contents - FSg curatorial research specialist remark on Antoin Sevruguin photo manipulation reads, \"The sky is covered with black paper. The area between the paper and the horizon line is filled with black ink.\"",
