        "Scope and Contents - Myron Bement Smith handwritten caption in English reads, \"47.P; Box 30.12: (P) [black-and-white print on hand]. Fars. Persepolis. Takht-i Jamshid.\" [Myron Bement Smith Collection, Subseries 2.1: Islamic Archives History, Collection Information; Box 60; Folder 44: 47 P: Antoine Sevruguin, glass negatives, Iran]",
