        "Local Numbers FSA A.4 2.12.GN.31.12",
        "Scope and Contents - FSg curatorial research specialist remark on Antoin Sevruguin photo manipulation reads, \"The sky is covered with black paper. The area between the paper and the horizon line is filled with black ink. The negative seems to be cleaned around the top edges of the columns and the horizon line.\"",
        "Scope and Contents - Handwritten number (inked, probably by Antoin Sevruguin) not readable.",
