        "General Title and summary note are provided by Shabnam Rahimi-Golkhandan, FSg curatorial research specialist.",
        "Local Numbers FSA A.4 2.12.GN.39.08",
        "Scope and Contents - Handwritten number (inked, probably by Antoin Sevruguin) reads, \"173.\"",
        "Scope and Contents - Myron Bement Smith handwritten caption in English reads, \"47.P; Box 39.8: (P) [black-and-white print on hand]. Kirmanshah. Tak-i Bustan. Relief.\" [Myron Bement Smith Collection, Subseries 2.1: Islamic Archives History, Collection Information; Box 60; Folder 44: 47 P: Antoine Sevruguin, glass negatives, Iran]",
        "Scope and Contents - Scratched handwritten number (inked, probably by Antoin Sevruguin) reads, \"398.\"" ;
