        "Scope and Contents - Handwritten information on slip of paper (from a 1943-1944 cash book, produced by the Bathni Brothers, Tehran) reads, \"309) Si o se pol-Isfahan.\" [Myron Bement Smith Collection, Subseries 2.1: Islamic Archives History, Collection Information]",
        "Scope and Contents - Handwritten number (inked, probably by Antoin Sevruguin) reads, \"641.\"",
