        "Scope and Contents - Handwritten number (inked, probably by Antoin Sevruguin) reads, \"524.\"",
        "Scope and Contents - Myron Bement Smith handwritten caption in English reads, \"47.P; Box 47.5: Fars. Naksh-i Rustam. Carving. (yellowing + peeling).\" [Myron Bement Smith Collection, Subseries 2.1: Islamic Archives History, Collection Information; Box 60; Folder 44: 47 P: Antoine Sevruguin, glass negatives, Iran]",
        "Scope and Contents - Scratched handwritten number (inked, probably by Antoin Sevruguin) reads, \"---(?).\"" ;
