        "Scope and Contents - Handwritten information on slip of paper (from a 1943-1944 cash book, produced by the Bathni Brothers, Tehran) reads, \"239) Son of King of Bahrein.\" [Myron Bement Smith Collection, Subseries 2.1: Islamic Archives History, Collection Information]",
        "Scope and Contents - Myron Bement Smith handwritten caption in English reads, \"47.P; Box 54.12: Son of a King of Bahrain (239).\" [Myron Bement Smith Collection, Subseries 2.1: Islamic Archives History, Collection Information; Box 60; Folder 44: 47 P: Antoine Sevruguin, glass negatives, Iran]" ;
