        "Scope and Contents - On verso of the print (lower left corner), original stamp, in French and Persian, reads, \"Photographie Sevruguin.\"",
        "Scope and Contents - On verso of the print, Myron Bement Smith caption in English reads, \"Persia; Tehran; Chasme Ali?; rock relief [Qajar bas relief].\"" ;
