        "Local Numbers [19(D3)] FSA A.4 2.12.Sm.76",
        "Scope and Contents \"Built in mid 14th century on the road to Mashhad, the tomb houses a Mihrab inside. The photograph is the view towards north and from the southern façade of the structure.\" [Freer Gallery of Art and Arthur M. Sackler Gallery Archives, Curatorial Research Assistant]",
