        "Local Numbers FSA A.4 2.12.GN.03.02",
        "Scope and Contents \"Judging by the lone man's headgear, the scene could be taken on Karun river.\" [Freer Gallery of Art and Arthur M. Sackler Gallery Archives, Curatorial Research Assistant]",
