    crm:P3_has_note "Scope and Contents note The Islamic Archives includes a small number of lantern slides. Some have Islamic Archives alphanumeric accession numbers but two of the larger collections are unnumbered. One of the latter includes the colored lantern slides for an an illustrated lecture on an Iranian Muharram celebration in the 1930s or before. Another set of mostly black and white lantern slides depicts Turkey in the 1930s." ;
