    crm:P1_is_identified_by kg:title_ref8800 ;
    crm:P3_has_note "Scope and Contents note This material includes the original negatives from Myron Bement Smith's (MBS) photography during his field research in Iran in the 1930s. The negatives are arranged according to the numbering system MBS used in his photograph registers, that is, plain numbers refer to large format negatives and L numbers refer to Leica 35 mm negatives [See Subseries 2.5]. MBS M number negatives denote photographs and plans copied from published material." ;
